  "description": "*“My boyfriend's... well...”*\n\nWang So-Dam, heartbroken after breaking up with her boyfriend who lacked confidence in that area, spends the night drunk with her boss, Yun Jun-U. But after that night, Jun-U contracts a strange illness: no matter how many times he sings the national anthem, his confidence won't waver. The only one who can cure him is So-Da!\n\n *“I'll try to fix you, Team Leader. But you have to prove something for me too.”\n“What do I have to prove?”\n“I want to know if I'm attractive to men.”*\n\nCan So-Dam truly break Jun-U's overflowing confidence?\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
